\"group-hover/item:underline underline-offset-2 headlight text-slate-800\">CSIR-NPL MTS भर्ती 2026: 10वीं पास के लिए मल्टी टास्किंग स्टाफ (25 पद) ऑफलाइन आवेदन शुरू, अंतिम तिथि 23 दिसंबर</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-slate-400 font-mono select-none mx-2\">•</span></a><a href=\"/?vacancy=ssc-cgl-tier-1-result-2026\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-[#15803d] transition text-xs font-semibold cursor-pointer group/item text-left\" title=\"SSC CGL टियर-1 रिजल्ट 2026 जारी: मेरिट सूची एवं कैटेगरी वाइज कट-ऑफ PDF यहाँ देखें\"><span class=\"text-[10px] bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Central Govt</span><span class=\"group-hover/item:underline underline-offset-2 headlight text-slate-800\">SSC CGL टियर-1 रिजल्ट 2026 जारी: मेरिट सूची एवं कैटेगरी वाइज कट-ऑफ PDF यहाँ देखें</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-slate-400 font-mono select-none mx-2\">•</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 shadow-xs\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-2.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"no-link-color flex items-center gap-2.5 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition no-underline\" title=\"Rajasthan Vacancy Home\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-lg bg-[#15803d] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-extrabold shadow-xs\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"text-center leading-none\"><span class=\"text-[9px] block font-mono text-white font-bold\">RAJ</span><span class=\"text-xs font-black tracking-tight text-white\">JOBS</span></div></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"text-lg sm:text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 flex items-center leading-tight\"><span>Rajasthan</span><span class=\"text-[#15803d] font-black ml-1\">Vacancy</span></span></div><p class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs